# Staging canary working directory.
#
# Holds a live SQLite database, its WAL, PID files and raw metric streams. None
# of it belongs in git: the database can be gigabytes, the WAL changes every
# second, and a canary database is by definition a copy of something that must
# not be published. The *report* generated from it is committed; the material
# it was generated from is not.
.staging/

# Snapshot cua store that — noi dung ky uc ca nhan, KHONG bao gio push
activation/**/*.db
